The same four lines, paid for twice or not at all
Two columns. On the left, work held in a queue of its own: history only if
somebody wrote it, an audit trail built separately, an owner modelled again,
and the work in flight when the node died. On the right, the same four lines
for a run that is an ordinary record: history, an audit trail, an owner, and
never having been in flight. Nothing was added to get the right-hand column.
